- Path exists, is a directory → OK
- Path exists, is a symlink to directory → OK
- Path exists, is a symlink to file → raise EEXIST (FileExistsError)
- Path exists, is a regular file → raise EEXIST (FileExistsError)
- Path doesn't exist → create it

